    <string name="call_mode_help">Only separate calls from the same VIP number count — cellular or messenger. The window starts with the first call; answering resets it. The first call keeps the normal phone sound settings. Pauses and Quiet Hours block all overrides and reset the count. Messages keep their separate sound setting. Each VIP can override the general call rule from its menu.</string>
